  "description": "Binary fuse filters (Graf and Lemire, 2022) for .NET: immutable approximate-membership filters that are smaller and faster to query than Bloom filters. 8-, 16- and 32-bit fingerprint variants (about 9 bits per key at 0.39% false positives, 18 bits at 0.0015%, 36 bits at 2e-8%). Pre-hashed ulong key API plus a generic filter over any type with pluggable hashing and XxHash64 defaults. Compact versioned binary serialization. Thread-safe queries that never throw. Pure managed C#, no native dependencies, runs everywhere .NET runs.",
